ard survival missions and exploring the game mastering new weapons n such, but once you do this it's the end of the journey. I sometimes login to remind myself of the game do a quickie mission for the funzies but thats about it.", "timestamp_created": 1479852480, "timestamp_updated": 1479852480, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26753336", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058432612", "personaname": "MonsterT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Monster-T/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 39299, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6015, "last_played": 1651086745, "avatar": "96e2874e1cf8be06537471b8187c031277c3ec7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best f2p games out there - without a single question.", "timestamp_created": 1479850183, "timestamp_updated": 1479850183, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}